Add a heading colour to the theme

Headings were drawn in the text's colour, larger and bold, with no way
for a theme to set them apart. A theme may now give heading-color; left
out, headings follow text-color as before, and a heading coloured the
same as the text is drawn exactly as it was, so the default output and
its snapshots are unchanged.

